SHIN|verdict=SHIN|what=every text receipt committed 2026-10-08 before this fix|measured=fresh clone of the public repo: GIMEL=0 SHIN=4 among path-adjacent sidecars|examples=CORRECTION.hbp claims d6c34721cd7bbd9f but working gave 696d8107a2a04c38; INDEX.hbp claims 0194423f6c9a74a8 but working gave 1b90fef8e5dab456|cause=no .gitattributes in the repo, so git converted LF to CRLF on checkout and the receipts stopped reproducing their own digests|already_known=the ASOLARIA-UNIVERSE-SIMULATOR .gitattributes documents this exact failure: core.autocrlf rewrote FABLE5-SEE-SELF-64.hbp from 1142 B to 1155 B and broke its own sidecar|fault=mine: I pushed nine commits while git printed the CRLF warning each time and I did not measure the result|json=0
SHIN|verdict=SHIN|what=sidecar placement for all 20 per-minute receipts|measured=receipts/ held 20 artifacts and 0 sidecars; 24 sidecars sat in the repo root naming files not present there|cause=write_bundle used p.file_name() and wrote sidecars to the output root instead of beside the artifact|note=this is the SAME defect class I had reported in the simulator one hour earlier as a finding: a receipt with no adjacent artifact. I found 5 there and then created 24 here.|json=0
GIMEL|verdict=GIMEL|what=the ten photographs|measured=min01 041d36c6d96f58b1, min06 fb51a34ab313127a, min10 816d5e23aac99430 byte-identical between fresh clone and origin|why=git auto-detected PNG as binary and left it untouched, so the binary lane held even without the harness|json=0
FIX|part=1|action=added .gitattributes carrying the harness law|detail=base * -text so nothing is converted by default; receipts, laws and sidecars pinned text eol=lf; png gguf bin wasm pinned binary|source=reused verbatim from Lynn's chariots and the universe simulator, not reinvented|json=0
FIX|part=2|action=moved every receipt sidecar beside its artifact and regenerated from LF bytes|detail=20 sidecars moved from the repo root into receipts/; 24 sidecars regenerated; 0 stranded sidecars remain|json=0
FIX|part=3|action=recorded this verdict beside the fix|detail=the SHIN rows above are not deleted and not edited away; the stone keeps the mark|json=0
